   "in_a_case": true,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Unassigned\" is the first option, checked when nobody is picked, then every active sales representative.",
   "where": "design-drive-2026-10-19/unpacked/files/canvas.json:680",
   "in_a_case": true,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Becky Gonzales is the Sales Representative, shown as plain text. She gets credit for the whole job: labor, parts and shop supplies.",
   "where": "design-drive-2026-10-19/unpacked/files/canvas.json:688",
   "in_a_case": true,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "With a person in the field, hovering shows the same box and arrow, and the + beside the row. To clear it, pick \"Unassigned\" from the list (decision 69).",
   "where": "design-drive-2026-10-19/unpacked/files/canvas.json:696",
