   "in_a_case": true,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Both boxes show at once, each with its arrow. With Labor and Parts showing, the arrow sits on the name line in the bottom corner (decision 70). The + is gone (nothing left to add); the Parts row has a grey x beside it that removes the row.",
   "where": "design-drive-2026-10-19/unpacked/files/canvas.json:728",
   "in_a_case": true,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "With Labor and Parts showing, the arrow sits on the name line in the bottom corner (decision 70). Each row has the same list: Unassigned first, then the reps. A person already on the other row is not hidden (decision 67).",
   "where": "design-drive-2026-10-19/unpacked/files/canvas.json:736",
   "in_a_case": true,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Daniel Montoya sold the labor, Becky Gonzales the parts. On the invoice and in Sales By Representative, each gets only their own side; shop supplies ride with Labor.",
   "where": "design-drive-2026-10-19/unpacked/files/canvas.json:744",
   "in_a_case": true,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Tooltip: \"Remove Sales Representative - Parts\". With Labor and Parts showing, the arrow sits on the name line in the bottom corner (decision 70).",
