   "in_a_case": true,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Removing the Parts row leaves the Labor person, Daniel Montoya, as the one Sales Representative for the whole job (decision 66). Becky is not put back.",
   "where": "design-drive-2026-10-19/unpacked/files/canvas.json:760",
   "in_a_case": true,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "To clear the field, open its list and pick \"Unassigned\", the first option (decision 69). Daniel Montoya is checked as the current rep.",
   "where": "design-drive-2026-10-19/unpacked/files/canvas.json:768",
   "in_a_case": true,
   "library": false,
   "on_a_board": true,
   "class": ""
  },
